/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cc9f07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9cc9f07\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Peningkatan Kapasitas SDM <\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-592e57d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"592e57d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c68e5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3c68e5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"513\" src=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-768x513.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-2914\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/20241007-Pelatihan-Pemandu-Wisata-Gili-Balu_C1-33-2048x1368.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47f4c84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"47f4c84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Peningkatan Kapasitas SDM menargetkan 100 penerima manfaat langsung dan tidak langsung. Sub-kegiatan dalam program ini meliputi pelatihan manajemen sampah (10 orang), pelatihan ecotourism dan wisata petualangan (20 orang), pelatihan dan sertifikasi penyedia wisata alam perairan dan olahraga air (20 orang), serta pelatihan dan sertifikasi pekerja di bidang hospitality (20 orang). Selain itu, terdapat pelatihan pemandu wisata, digital marketing, rehabilitasi dan perlindungan tapak lokasi area landing\/nesting penyu, serta legal drafting (Perdes).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1347b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c1347b7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec3c04d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ec3c04d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29b1b56 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29b1b56\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Semua pelatihan teknis, termasuk pelatihan pemandu wisata, digital marketing, rehabilitasi dan perlindungan tapak lokasi area landing\/nesting penyu, serta legal drafting (Perdes), akan dilaksanakan pada Tahun 2024 dengan rincian time line pelaksanaan yang dijelaskan dalam Rencana Aksi. Pada Tahun 2023, telah disusun rencana aksi capacity building yang mencakup penentuan tematik training, target peserta, dan silabus topik materi pelatihan.<\/p><p>Hingga tahun 2024 ini, telah berhasil terlaksana pelatihan teknis meliputi pelatihan pemandu wisata sekaligus sertifikasi pemandu wisata (BNSP), pelatihan teknis rehabilitasi ekosistem, dan pelatihan digital marketing yang diikuti oleh Kelompok Pengelola Wisata Gili Balu Poto Tano.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90eae6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-qi_addons_for_elementor_image_gallery\" data-id=\"90eae6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"qi_addons_for_elementor_image_gallery.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"qodef-shortcode qodef-m  qodef-qi-image-gallery qodef-qi-fslightbox-popup qodef-popup-gallery qodef-image--hover-zoom  qodef-qi-grid qodef-layout--qi-columns  qodef-col-num--2   qodef-responsive--predefined\">\n\t<div class=\"qodef-grid-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"qodef-e qodef-image-wrapper qodef-grid-item\">\n\t<div class=\"qodef-e-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"qodef-popup-item\" itemprop=\"image\" href=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/IMG_9578-scaled.jpg\" data-type=\"image\" data-fslightbox=\"gallery-422\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1300\" height=\"650\" src=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/IMG_9578-1300x650.jpg\" class=\"attachment-qi_addons_for_elementor_image_size_landscape size-qi_addons_for_elementor_image_size_landscape\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"qodef-e qodef-image-wrapper qodef-grid-item\">\n\t<div class=\"qodef-e-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"qodef-popup-item\" itemprop=\"image\" href=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC00409-2-scaled.jpg\" data-type=\"image\" data-fslightbox=\"gallery-422\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1300\" height=\"650\" src=\"https:\/\/gilibalutransformasea.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC00409-2-1300x650.jpg\" class=\"attachment-qi_addons_for_elementor_image_size_landscape size-qi_addons_for_elementor_image_size_landscape\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div clas